--- !yfi/header
version: 1
namespace: cap::open
visibility: public
--- !node &Free
pub port: 1
# `!ref` in a connections item is the same declaration of intent it is
# anywhere else: this edge relates the endpoint **and** declares that it means
# to modify it. `E0217` — a scope that says nothing is immutable.
--- !edge &Governs
pub connections: [!ref ../locked/Locked, Free]
